<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine August industrial output up 9.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Argentine August industrial output up 9.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine industrial output rose 9.2 percent in August compared with the same month a year earlier, according to preliminary figures released Monday by the FIEL economic research institute.</p>
<p>Industrial output advanced 1.2 percent in the first eight months of the year compared with the same period in 1995.</p>
</text>
